WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.994
The days are getting shorter.

2
00:00:08.995 --> 00:00:11.388
The air is getting colder.

3
00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:17.308
Jack and Sally go out to play.

4
00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:19.175
"Look at the squirrel!

5
00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:21.066
What is he doing?"

6
00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:23.596
"I'm not sure."

7
00:00:23.597 --> 00:00:26.523
"What are you doing, Mr. Squirrel?"

8
00:00:26.524 --> 00:00:28.766
"I'm gathering nuts."

9
00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:30.393
"Can we help?"

10
00:00:30.394 --> 00:00:36.987
"Oh yes, please."

11
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:39.215
"What are the birds doing?"

12
00:00:39.216 --> 00:00:43.533
"I'll ask."

13
00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:46.830
"Mr. Bird, what are you doing?"

14
00:00:46.831 --> 00:00:49.681
"We're flying away for the winter."

15
00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.984
"Can we come?"

16
00:00:50.985 --> 00:00:52.642
"No, you cannot.

17
00:00:52.643 --> 00:00:58.310
I don't think you can fly."

18
00:00:58.311 --> 00:01:00.703
"What is your uncle doing, Jack?"

19
00:01:00.704 --> 00:01:03.722
"I don't know."

20
00:01:03.723 --> 00:01:06.279
"Uncle Steve, what are you doing?"

21
00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:08.430
"I'm picking apples."

22
00:01:08.431 --> 00:01:09.920
"Can we help?"

23
00:01:09.921 --> 00:01:17.077
"Sure you can."

24
00:01:17.078 --> 00:01:20.537
"Hey, what is your mother doing?

25
00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:22.550
That looks like fun!"

26
00:01:22.551 --> 00:01:25.917
"Not sure."

27
00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.417
"Mom, what are you doing?"

28
00:01:28.418 --> 00:01:30.861
"I'm carving a pumpkin."

29
00:01:30.862 --> 00:01:32.612
"Can we help?"

30
00:01:32.613 --> 00:01:39.665
"Of course, there are many pumpkins to carve."

31
00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:41.782
"Look at your dad!

32
00:01:41.783 --> 00:01:43.977
What is your dad doing?"

33
00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:46.933
"I don't know."

34
00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.009
"Dad, what are you doing?"

35
00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:50.916
"I'm raking leaves."

36
00:01:50.917 --> 00:01:52.268
"Can we help?"

37
00:01:52.269 --> 00:01:54.846
"Okay, I guess you can.

38
00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:59.774
Here are the rakes."

39
00:01:59.775 --> 00:02:02.469
"What a big pile of leaves!"

40
00:02:02.470 --> 00:02:04.673
"Do you want to jump into them?"

41
00:02:04.674 --> 00:02:11.791
"Yeah, let's jump." "Wee! Wee!"

42
00:02:11.792 --> 00:02:19.553
"Oh no! What a mess!"
